WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.625
Brackets keep a part together, so it is worked out first.

2
00:00:04.178 --> 00:00:06.853
Add three to n, then double the result.

3
00:00:07.581 --> 00:00:09.831
The first step is n plus three.

4
00:00:10.684 --> 00:00:14.584
Double the whole result, so brackets keep n plus three together.

5
00:00:15.438 --> 00:00:18.938
With four: four plus three is seven, doubled is fourteen.

6
00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:23.534
With five: eight, doubled, is sixteen.
